pe&quot;:&quot;image/jpg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="yellow, orange, red, green, and blue abstract painting" title="yellow, orange, red, green, and blue abstract painting" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543857778-c4a1a3e0b2eb?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNHx8Y29sb3Vyc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzI3NDE1MTR8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543857778-c4a1a3e0b2eb?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNHx8Y29sb3Vyc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzI3NDE1MTR8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543857778-c4a1a3e0b2eb?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNHx8Y29sb3Vyc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzI3NDE1MTR8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543857778-c4a1a3e0b2eb?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNHx8Y29sb3Vyc3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzI3NDE1MTR8MA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@markusspiske">Markus Spiske</a> on <a href="https://unsplash.com">Unsplash</a></figcaption></figure></div><p>Los colores también son adjetivos.<br>Pero no todos se comportan igual.</p><p>Algunos cambian:</p><p>Blanco / blanca<br>Rojo / roja<br>Negro / negra</p><p>La casa blanca.<br>El coche blanco.</p><p>Otros no cambian en género:</p><p>Azul<br>Verde<br>Gris</p><p>La casa azul.<br>El coche azul.</p><p>Pero en plural sí cambian:</p><p>Casas azules.<br>Pantalones grises.</p><p>Spanish likes to keep you alert.</p><div><hr></div><p>Know someone who’s learning Spanish and might enjoy these articles? Share this with them, and you’ll be doing a triple favour: you help me grow this community, your friend improves their Spanish, and you get to be the cool friend who shares great resources. ✨</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/soluciones-un-pequeno-reto-extra?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/soluciones-un-pequeno-reto-extra?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Nos leemos pronto,<br>Ms Myriam</p>]]></content:encoded>
